{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22483","headline":"重过寿泉忆与杨九别时因题店壁 · 白居易","name":"重过寿泉忆与杨九别时因题店壁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"商州南十里，有水名寿泉。\n涌出石崖下，流经山店前。\n忆昔相送日，我去君言还。\n寒波与老泪，此地共潺湲。\n一去历万里，再来经六年。\n形容已变改，处所犹依然。\n他日君过此，殷懃吟此篇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22483.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22483","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}